"description": "Tennant Co. engages in the design, manufacture, and marketing of cleaning solutions. Its products include equipment for maintaining surfaces in industrial, commercial, and outdoor environments, detergent-free and other sustainable cleaning technologies, cleaning tools and supplies, and coatings for protecting, repairing and upgrading surfaces. It operates through the following geographic segments: Americas, Europe, Middle East, and Africa, and Asia Pacific. The company was founded by George Henry Tennant in 1870 and is headquartered in Eden Prairie, MN.",
